# The slope's foundation (docs/slope.md): the ground, the geometry, the stone and the inks, with stand-in pebbles and
# words where the screens will set their own (UNSTIR_SLOPE, SlopeHarness). Sourced in order by scripts/shots.sh.
shot slope-overview "The slope's overview: the whole main column, the surface under the wordmark, the shallows' three ledges, each tier's three terraces of nine pebbles in its own rock, the drop-off; plughole's first 13 lit, the 14th the way on." \
  SLOPE=overview CLOCK=3
shot slope-dive-top "The dive at the top of its travel: the bank and its stone, the surface, the shallows' ledges, plughole's header." SLOPE=dive CLOCK=3
shot slope-dive-plughole-14 "The dive at plughole 14: a pebble seated on each ledge's lip, its number, name and facts beside it, the lips stepping out in nines, hollows in the wall." \
  SLOPE=dive SLOPEAT=L14 CLOCK=3
shot slope-dive-whirlpool "The dive at whirlpool 05, plughole done: mauve scallops in purple water." SLOPE=dive SLOPEAT=N5 SLOPESOLVED=31 CLOCK=3
shot slope-dive-vortex "The dive at vortex 12: slate plates in blue water." SLOPE=dive SLOPEAT=V12 SLOPESOLVED=65 CLOCK=3
shot slope-dive-maelstrom "The dive at maelstrom 20: basalt pillows in red-black water." SLOPE=dive SLOPEAT=M20 SLOPESOLVED=100 CLOCK=3
shot slope-drop-off "The dive's foot: under maelstrom's last ledge the rock curves back off the screen, the ridges end and the water goes to near black; endless in the open water." \
  SLOPE=dive SLOPEAT=endless SLOPESOLVED=108 CLOCK=3
shot slope-dive-ax3 "The dive at plughole 14 at accessibility3: the slope at the leading edge, a taller pitch, no near silhouette, the words full size and whole." \
  SLOPE=dive SLOPEAT=L14 CLOCK=3 TYPESIZE=accessibility3
shot slope-overview-ax3 "The overview at accessibility3." SLOPE=overview CLOCK=3 TYPESIZE=accessibility3
shot slope-dive-428 "The dive at plughole 14 on the reference phone's 428 x 926 points: the lips 6 pt further in." \
  SLOPE=dive SLOPEAT=L14 CLOCK=3 FRAME=428x926 INSETS=47,0,34,0
shot slope-play "The ground as a level holds it at plughole 14: the shelf drawn aside, one terrace under the tank's place, two stones on it." \
  SLOPE=play SLOPEAT=L14 CLOCK=3
shot slope-play-prism "The same in Prism's clear water and white light, its stone pale." SLOPE=play SLOPEAT=L14 SLOPELOOK=clear CLOCK=3
shot slope-play-paper "The same on Escapement's paper: the terrace an engraving in ink on bone, the stones engraved." SLOPE=play SLOPEAT=L14 SLOPELOOK=paper CLOCK=3
shot slope-play-dim "The same at 0.35 of the ground's light, as consent draws it." SLOPE=play SLOPEAT=L14 SLOPELOOK=dim CLOCK=3
shot slope-hollow "The inside of a hollow: still dark water between two jambs of pale stone, a floor, a ledge, the cover's light in three beams." SLOPE=hollow
shot slope-pack "A pack's own column: five trays of six in pale rock and still water, scrolled." SLOPE=pack CLOCK=3
shot slope-stones "Every state of the stone on open water: lit, the way on, dull, armed, pending, pale, and one with its words leading." SLOPE=stones CLOCK=3
shot slope-stones-ax3 "The same at accessibility3: the words full size, the stones a little larger." SLOPE=stones CLOCK=3 TYPESIZE=accessibility3
